tpm 1
boot power
# select-option: power-on (blank card) to the mode select as boot-select; Left, Cross, Cross:
# Option mode. Up at the top row (no move); every row's keys: the rotation buttons with pad 1
# and pad 2 (Right through all eight, wrapping and skipping the other row's button; Left),
# difficulty and VS setting (Right wrapping 3 -> 0, Left wrapping 0 -> 3), stereo (Right, Left),
# music arrangement (Right, Right+Left: no change, Left), the music test (Left wraps to 49,
# Right, Cross plays a track), the sound test (Left, Right, Cross plays effects), BGM volume
# (Right to the top, Left to 0, Right), SE volume, the two card rows (Right, Left), Down at the
# last row (no move), Cross on Exit: back to the mode select; Up, Cross, Cross: VS Puzzle
# (SELECT exits to VSPUZ.EXE, not traced).
program SW_ON
program TIT_DEMO
100 1 START
program TITLE
100 1 START
program SELECT
